      "description": "<p>Grammy-winning pop star and Morando reportedly tied the knot ⁠at a private ceremony in Palm ​Springs</p><p>Grammy-winning pop star <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/music/miley-cyrus\">Miley ⁠Cyrus</a> married her longtime partner, drummer Maxx Morando, ⁠in California on ⁠Saturday, ​<a href=\"https://people.com/miley-cyrus-marries-maxx-morando-11877139\">People magazine</a> and other US entertainment news outlets ⁠reported.</p><p>Cyrus and Morando reportedly tied the knot ⁠at a private ceremony in Palm ​Springs, ‌a month ‌after performing Let’s Get Married together at ‌the Hollywood Bowl. The song appears on Cyrus’s latest studio album, Bass Persuades.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/nov/22/miley-cyrus-maxx-morando-wedding\">Continue reading...</a>",
